<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's INE to issue inflation data on Feb 17.</title>
<headline>Portugal's INE to issue inflation data on Feb 17.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute (INE) said on Friday it would release January consumer price index (CPI) data on Monday.</p>
<p>The Institute had expected to issue the numbers this Friday, but some data arrived late and forced a postponement, officials said.</p>
<p>--Lisbonn bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
